{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To The Skies</strong> is a fast-paced aerial racing game where you fly your surfboard through the air and on tracks, chaining tricks and carving turns to build boost and flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5d370eda3e782b5ccbdc170f8fa1b2d0.poster.avif?t=1762436963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5d370eda3e782b5ccbdc170f8fa1b2d0.webm?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5d370eda3e782b5ccbdc170f8fa1b2d0.mp4?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by arcade greats like <i>Wipeout</i>, <i>SSX Tricky</i>, and <i>Pilotwings.</i>\u00a0<i>To The Skies</i> blends high-speed racing with expressive movement. Each course challenges you to master the skies \u2014 from sunlit cloudscapes to stormy cityscapes \u2014 with dynamic obstacles, branching paths, and big-air stunts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tracks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/50b9329d11a690acff3c56378e6a27e9.poster.avif?t=1762436963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/50b9329d11a690acff3c56378e6a27e9.webm?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/50b9329d11a690acff3c56378e6a27e9.mp4?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain boost pads to find the best line on track sections.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move between Track and Air</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/c397bc39cdc5dd16b0070c89cce4cc8d.poster.avif?t=1762436963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/c397bc39cdc5dd16b0070c89cce4cc8d.webm?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/c397bc39cdc5dd16b0070c89cce4cc8d.mp4?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transition between modes, as the course demands... or to find a better route!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Moves</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/9f1138c40daceb766fbceea655733f59.poster.avif?t=1762436963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/9f1138c40daceb766fbceea655733f59.webm?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/9f1138c40daceb766fbceea655733f59.mp4?t=1762436963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special moves like 180s to navigate faster and open up new lines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Campaign Mode</strong>:Take on skill-based challenges to unlock new courses, tricks, board upgrades, and cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Dynamic Soundtrack</strong>: A high-energy soundtrack that evolves with your speed and flow.<br><br>\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong>: Climb the ranks by hitting perfect runs, optimizing routes, and pulling off risky tricks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Release:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To The Skies</i> is currently in development, targeting a mid 2026 release. Follow to stay updated on development progress, playtest invites, and future announcements.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930600?t=1762436963","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930600?t=1762436963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/af894e920767f280070e7c5cc54af8f41724f981/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762436963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/af894e920767f280070e7c5cc54af8f41724f981/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762436963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To The Skies</strong> is a fast-paced aerial racing game where you fly your surfboard through the air and on tracks, chaining tricks and carving turns to build boost and flow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Race!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5d370eda3e782b5ccbdc170f8fa1b2d0.poster.avif?t=1762436963\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930600/extras/5d370eda3e782b5ccbdc170f8fa1b2d0.webm?t=1762436963\" type=\"vide